WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.510 line:95%,end
We are now part of PubliX Group, and the reason we chose to join

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:11.870 line:95%,end
was that already when we were contacted, we felt great trust in

00:00:11.870 --> 00:00:16.570 line:95%,end
this buyer. That they were serious, that they treated us with respect,

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:22.590 line:95%,end
that they asked good, reasonable questions and really listened to our answers.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:32.750 line:95%,end
We also felt they were building a group of companies that all benefit society.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:38.010 line:95%,end
Then we felt we were entering a context with our crime prevention work,

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:43.670 line:95%,end
where we could get good synergies with the other companies –

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:47.030 line:95%,end
they have similar customers, really.
